.TH COGTRIX 5 "2026-03-30" "cogtrix 1.0.0" "Cogtrix Manual"
.SH NAME
cogtrix \- configuration file format
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ~/.cogtrix.json
.br
.B ./.cogtrix.json
.SH DESCRIPTION
Cogtrix reads configuration from a JSON file named
.B .cogtrix.json
located in the current working directory or the user home directory.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B model
Default model alias to use (e.g. \(lqsonnet\(rq, \(lqopus\(rq, \(lqhaiku\(rq).
.TP
.B memory_mode
Conversation memory strategy: \(lqconversation\(rq (default), \(lqsummary\(rq, or \(lqoff\(rq.
.TP
.B banner
Banner style on startup: \(lqcompact\(rq (default), \(lqfull\(rq, or \(lqoff\(rq.
.TP
.B max_tokens
Maximum tokens per response. Default: 8192.
.TP
.B services
Object containing service-specific configuration. Keys include:
.RS
.TP
.B searxng.url
URL of a SearXNG instance (e.g. \(lqhttp://localhost:8888\(rq).
.TP
.B exa.api_key
API key for Exa neural search.
.TP
.B brave.api_key
API key for Brave Search.
.TP
.B tavily.api_key
API key for Tavily search.
.RE
.TP
.B tool_trust
Per-tool trust overrides. Keys are tool names, values are \(lqalways\(rq, \(lqdeny\(rq, or \(lqask\(rq.
.TP
.B api_dangerous_tools
Boolean. When false (default), shell/bash/python_exec are denied in API sessions.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
Required. Anthropic API key for Claude model access.
.TP
.B SEARXNG_URL
URL of a SearXNG instance (overrides config file).
.TP
.B EXA_API_KEY
Exa API key (overrides config file).
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.cogtrix.json
User-level configuration file.
.TP
.B ./.cogtrix.json
Project-level configuration file (takes precedence).
.TP
.B COGTRIX.md
Optional project context file auto-loaded from cwd, home, or XDG config dir.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cogtrix (1),
.BR cogtrix (8)
